    <li>Most booking problems come from rules nobody wrote down, not from the software.</li>
    <li>Decide how credits, memberships, waitlists and cancellations work before building anything.</li>
    <li>Waitlists should promote people automatically, with a clear deadline to confirm.</li>
    <li>Full classes at release time need the same protections as any busy booking system.</li>
  </ul>
